  "decides": "A handoff selects a bounded set of exact draft record versions that only the Compliance Lead may mark ready_for_review; guests and advisors are admitted only against a ready, unrevoked and unclosed handoff. Closing or revoking ends advisor and guest access to its records immediately while history is retained.",
